TRANSPORT: figure-eight choreography, bodies exchanged by a TIME SHIFT
==============================================================================
  closest pair of diagram points over T/3 = 0.000e+00
  spread of birth values among the 3 bodies at t=0 = 3.779e-03
  body i's diagram point at t=0   : [1.00395 1.00395 1.00773]
  body i's diagram point at t=T/3 : [1.00773 1.00395 1.00395]
  -> body i lands on body i+1's starting values, and those values DIFFER,
     so the permutation is a permutation of distinct diagram points.
